━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ RowRange''Row is Tuple

` A contiguous run of rows in one pool, as the first row's index and the row count. The type
` parameter names the row type, so a range over the slot table reads as one and is never
` applied to the scope table by mistake. An empty range has no rows and no sentinel: every pool
` view slices it directly and yields nothing.

+ start U32
+ count U32

────────────────────
+ get end U32 @inline

start + count

────────────────────
+ get is-empty Bool @inline

count == 0

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ extend ImmutableArray''Item''Backing

────────────────────
+ this[range RowRange'Item] This @inline

this[range.start .. < range.end]

